{"title":"IQ / EQ","timeMinutes":10,"questions":[{"text":"What number comes next?\n2, 6, 12, 20, 30, ?","image":"","options":["36","40","42","44"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"All roses are flowers. Some flowers fade quickly. Which statement must be true?","image":"","options":["All roses fade quickly.","Some roses fade quickly.","All roses are flowers.","No roses fade quickly."],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"Which number does not belong?","image":"","options":["16","25","36","45"],"correctIdx":3},{"text":"A shirt costs ₹800. Its price is reduced by 25%. What is the new price?","image":"","options":["₹500","₹550","₹600","₹650"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"Book is to Reading as Fork is to _____?","image":"","options":["Drawing","Eating","Writing","Cooking"],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"What number comes next?\n3, 9, 27, 81, ?","image":"","options":["162","189","243","324"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"A father is three times as old as his son. Their combined age is 48 years. How old is the son?","image":"","options":["10 years","12 years","14 years","16 years"],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"A cube is painted red on all six sides and cut into 27 identical smaller cubes. How many small cubes have exactly three red faces?","image":"","options":["4","6","8","12"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"If 5 machines produce 5 toys in 5 minutes, how long would 100 identical machines take to produce 100 toys at the same rate?","image":"","options":["5 minutes","20 minutes","100 minutes","500 minutes"],"correctIdx":0},{"text":"You face north. You turn right, then right again, and finally left. Which direction are you facing?","image":"","options":["North","South","East","West"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"Someone insults you in front of other people. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Insult them back immediately.","Stay composed and respond assertively when appropriate.","Start a physical fight.","Plan revenge."],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"Your colleague makes a mistake and is visibly upset. What is the most emotionally intelligent response?","image":"","options":["Laugh at the mistake.","Tell everyone about it.","Understand their feelings and offer appropriate help.","Tell them they are useless."],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"Two friends are arguing, and both want you to take their side. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Automatically support your closest friend.","Listen to both sides before forming an opinion.","Spread the argument to other people.","Agree with whoever is angrier."],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"You make a serious mistake at work. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Blame someone else","Hide the mistake","Pretend nothing happened","Accept responsibility and work to correct it"],"correctIdx":3},{"text":"You are under pressure because you have several tasks to complete. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Panic and give up","Take your frustration out on others","Prioritize your tasks and handle them one at a time","Ignore every deadline"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"During a conversation, you realize that someone has misunderstood your words. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Tell them they are incapable of understanding simple things","Clarify what you meant and listen to how they interpreted it","End the conversation immediately","Insist that your words cannot be misunderstood"],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"A person apologizes to you, but you still feel hurt. What should you do?","image":"","options":["Pretend you have forgiven them even though you have not","Punish them until you feel better","Acknowledge the apology while giving yourself time to process your feelings","Tell them that apologies are always meaningless"],"correctIdx":2},{"text":"How many Cubes are there?","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","options":["17","13","15","16"],"correctIdx":0},{"text":"","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","options":["2kg","2.5kg","3kg","3.5kg"],"correctIdx":1},{"text":"height of owl = ?","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","options":["30","10","15","5"],"correctIdx":2}]}